# Launch data: your launches, practice runs, history, write records, and
# setup. Kept out of git so a copy of this repository does not publish them.
# A team that shares launches through its own private repository can remove
# this block there. The tracker, the playbook and connections.json are tracked
# and hold your launch data once you use them, so keep your copy private.
launches/
practice/
history/
runs/
setup/state.json
setup/policy.json
launch-folder/*
!launch-folder/README.md
